### Publish a new order
POST http://localhost:7071/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Jane Smith",
    "product": "Standing Desk",
    "quantity": 2,
    "unitPrice": 499.95
}

### Publish another order
POST http://localhost:7071/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "John Doe",
    "product": "Ergonomic Chair",
    "quantity": 1,
    "unitPrice": 349.00
}

###

### Create a new customer
POST http://localhost:7071/api/customers/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "new-customer-001",
    "firstName": "Mikkel",
    "lastName": "Andersen",
    "email": "mikkel.andersen@email.dk",
    "phone": "+45 55667788",
    "street": "Vesterbrogade 10",
    "city": "Copenhagen",
    "zipCode": "1620",
    "country": "Denmark",
    "status": "Active"
}

### Update a customer (partial update — only provided fields are applied)
POST http://localhost:7071/api/customers/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerId": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "email": "anna.jensen@newdomain.dk",
    "phone": "+45 99887766"
}
